# Paired with a group that has Topics. The first notification for a session opens a
# topic named after it and lands there. A message typed into General gets a hint; a
# message typed into the session's topic reaches the session without any Reply.

size 110x30
arg --mux
fake_telegram forum
session existing-app Existing app session

wait_for Existing app session
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot is idling
type e2e:work 1500 Checkpoint reached. Waiting for a go-ahead before deploying.
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session

telegram_wait topic: Existing app session
telegram_wait message in Existing app session: Checkpoint reached
telegram_wait Checkpoint reached
telegram_dump 01-topic-made

telegram_say_bare which one of you is this for?
telegram_wait Type in a session's topic to answer that session.

telegram_say Go ahead and deploy
press enter
wait_for Fake Copilot is idling
wait_for Fake Copilot received: Go ahead and deploy
telegram_wait reaction on
dump 02-topic-reply-delivered
telegram_dump 02-topic-reply-delivered

# A second turn reuses the topic rather than opening another.
type e2e:work 1000
press enter
press ctrl+b d
wait_for Existing app session
wait 2000
telegram_dump 03-second-turn
